# Bangla (bn) translations for BloodBond.
#
# REVIEW NEEDED: this catalogue was written without a native-speaker review.
# The wording is meant to be plain, respectful and in common Bangladeshi usage,
# but every string should be read by a native Bangla speaker before it is
# treated as final. Health and safety copy keeps its hedges: eligibility is a
# reminder, never medical clearance.
#
# This file is the source of truth and is maintained by hand (no GNU gettext on
# the build machine). After editing it:
#   python manage.py compile_po          # writes django.mo (commit both)
#   python scripts/check_translations.py # lists strings with no translation
#
